1. **Inheritance Pattern**: HCE is inherited in an autosomal inheritance pattern, meaning that the disorder is not specific to either paternal or maternal parents. A child needs only one copy of the HCE allele to be affected, but they will not be affected by the disorder. However, if both parents are affected, the child has a 50% chance of inheriting two copies of the HCE allele and having a more severe disorder.

