     \[
     \ln \left( \frac{[A]_0}{[A]} \right) = kt
     \]  
     where \( [A]_0 \) is the initial concentration of ammonium cyanate, \( [A] \) is the concentration of ammonium cyanate at time \( t \), and \( k \) is the rate constant.  
